Welcome to Renux!

Renux is a general-purpose operating system, built with Zig alone.
Website: https://renuxproject.github.io/
Source:  https://github.com/renuxproject/renux

Renux is based on FreeBSD; FreeBSD's documentation applies:
FreeBSD Handbook:      https://www.FreeBSD.org/handbook/
FreeBSD FAQ:           https://www.FreeBSD.org/faq/

Show the version installed:  freebsd-version ; uname -a
Introduction to manual pages:  man man
Directory layout:              man hier

To change this login announcement, see motd(5).
